    {
      "x": 120.69085,
      "y": 366.564,
      "w": 516.3009,
      "h": 115.19999999999999,
      "font": "Display",
      "size": 48,
      "role": "heading",
      "text": "The clinical question"
    },
    {
      "x": 120.69085,
      "y": 489.564,
      "w": 516.3009,
      "h": 259.2,
      "font": "Body",
      "size": 36,
      "role": "body",
      "text": "Which EEG-to-BOLD estimates could support one clinical action? Test regional fidelity and failure modes before considering patient-specific fMRI replacement."
    },
    {
      "x": 119.42254,
      "y": 840.416,
      "w": 517.5692,
      "h": 57.599999999999994,
      "font": "Display",
