      "text": "Published reference; not tested here.<br/>Patient BOLD/utility unvalidated."
    },
    {
      "x": 750.6812,
      "y": 366.141989,
      "w": 1510.084,
      "h": 57.599999999999994,
      "font": "Display",
      "size": 48,
      "role": "heading",
      "text": "A computer science thesis to explore"
    },
    {
      "x": 750.6812,
      "y": 447.141989,
      "w": 1510.084,
      "h": 440,
      "font": "Body",
      "size": 36,
      "role": "body",
      "text": "<b>Thesis aim:</b> identify which BOLD information is recoverable, then build models that generalise and know when to abstain. This explores a possible computer science PhD.<br/><br/><b>Candidate contributions:</b> multimodal system identification; robust person/site transfer; calibrated, selective regional prediction. Establish novelty against UnEBOLT, MARBLE and UniEFS, rather than promising clinical replacement.<br/><br/><b>First application:</b> a wakefulness advisory prompting technologist review. Compare direct arousal prediction: BOLD synthesis must earn its complexity. One regional feedback target is a conditional second route. Diagnostic mapping needs a separate validation programme."
    },
    {
      "x": 750.6812,
      "y": 940.499997,
      "w": 1510.084,
      "h": 57.599999999999994,
      "font": "Display",
      "size": 48,
      "role": "heading",
      "text": "Working hypothesis"
    },
    {
      "x": 750.6812,
      "y": 1015.499997,
      "w": 1510.084,
      "h": 172,
      "font": "Body",
      "size": 36,
      "role": "body",
      "text": "Predictive value may depend more on measured information and target definition than on model size. Cross people, duration, sensors and capacity on fixed holdouts. A nonlinear gain would favour richer models; an added-sensor gain would favour acquisition. Null results and small learning curves cannot establish a biological ceiling."
    },
    {
      "x": 734.0,
      "y": 1252.0,
      "w": 439.0,
      "h": 32.769999999999996,
      "font": "Body",
      "size": 29,
      "role": "diagram",
      "text": "Offline prediction"
    },
    {
