      "y": 1920.803,
      "w": 874.1018,
      "h": 294,
      "font": "Body",
      "size": 35,
      "role": "body",
      "text": "<b>ds006040 development:</b> 27 people/54 runs; three outer folds, 96 fitted outer cells. Inner tuning separate. Matched inputs: 300 EEG-power features, ECG timing/availability or both; ridge/small MLP. Cross 4/12 training people x 120/240 retained target-seconds. One seed; four equal-weight MLP target groups. Published models were not reproduced."
