      "text": "R2 -0.071; 740/2304 frames (32.1%).<br/>Frozen VU model/thresholds; 23 target sites include interpolation."
    },
    {
      "x": 1101.925,
      "y": 2302.198,
      "w": 1158.341,
      "h": 57.599999999999994,
      "font": "Display",
      "size": 48,
      "role": "heading",
      "text": "Three proposed work packages"
    },
    {
      "x": 1101.925,
      "y": 2379.198,
      "w": 1158.341,
      "h": 78,
      "font": "Body",
      "size": 33,
      "role": "body",
      "text": "<b>WP1 | Measurement design.</b> Rank montage, history and sensors; test held-out gains against cost-matched choices."
    },
    {
      "x": 1101.925,
      "y": 2470.198,
      "w": 1158.341,
      "h": 78,
      "font": "Body",
      "size": 33,
      "role": "body",
      "text": "<b>WP2 | Structured estimation.</b> Learn shared dynamics with counted calibration. Test regional gains beyond ridge and state/physiology controls."
    },
    {
      "x": 1101.925,
      "y": 2561.198,
      "w": 1158.341,
      "h": 78,
      "font": "Body",
      "size": 33,
      "role": "body",
      "text": "<b>WP3 | Selective prediction.</b> Report error at useful coverage under stated shift assumptions; compare quality rejection."
    },
    {
      "x": 1101.925,
      "y": 2770.2483,
      "w": 1158.341,
      "h": 57.599999999999994,
      "font": "Display",
      "size": 48,
      "role": "heading",
      "text": "Clinical uses and limits"
    },
    {
      "x": 1101.925,
      "y": 2849.2483,
      "w": 1158.341,
      "h": 287,
      "font": "Body",
      "size": 34,
      "role": "body",
      "text": "<b>Clinical precedent:</b> Prism's fMRI-informed EEG biofeedback is cleared for adjunctive PTSD treatment; diagnostic interpretation is excluded [4].<br/><b>Proposed:</b> wakefulness support or one regional feedback target. Disease classification does not verify patient BOLD recovery.<br/><b>M3 limits:</b> inherited preprocessing is retrospective; no absolute %BOLD calibration. Causal inputs do not establish end-to-end live use. Sparse ECG; one development site/seed; clinical benefit untested [5]."
    },
    {
      "x": 1101.925,
      "y": 3139.2483,
      "w": 1158.341,
      "h": 87,
      "font": "Body",
      "size": 24,
      "role": "references",
      "text": "<link href=\"https://proceedings.mlr.press/v315/li26g.html\"><b>[1]</b> UnEBOLT, MIDL 2026.</link> <link href=\"https://proceedings.mlr.press/v306/li26gp.html\"><b>[2]</b> UniEFS, ICML 2026.</link><br/><link href=\"https://papers.miccai.org/miccai-2026/0612-Paper4437.html\"><b>[3]</b> MARBLE, MICCAI 2026.</link> <link href=\"https://www.accessdata.fda.gov/cdrh_docs/pdf22/K222101.pdf\"><b>[4]</b> FDA K222101, 2023.</link><br/><link href=\"https://www.bmj.com/content/377/bmj-2022-070904\"><b>[5]</b> DECIDE-AI, 2022.</link> Full sources: accompanying report."
    },
